<title>JAPAN: Japan March aluminium output, shipments rise.</title>
<headline>Japan March aluminium output, shipments rise.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese output and shipments of fabricated aluminium products climbed in March from the same period last year, the seventh increase in a row, the Japan Aluminum Federation said on Friday.</p>
<p>The March data was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		   March 97     yr/yr change    Feb 97 (revised)</p>
<p> Output	   228,916	+7.7 pct	 209,002 (+3.4 pct)</p>
<p>   Flat-rolled  117,727	+5.3 pct	 102,569 (+1.0 pct)</p>
<p>   Extrusions   111,189     +10.4 pct	 106,433 (+5.9 pct)</p>
<p> Shipments	224,944	+7.9 pct	 210,516 (+5.0 pct)</p>
<p>   Flat-rolled  113,864	+4.4 pct	 104,552 (+3.2 pct)</p>
<p>   Extrusions   111,080     +11.8 pct	 105,964 (+6.8 pct)</p>
<p> Inventories     86,579	+6.7 pct	  82,803 (+6.9 pct)</p>
<p>   Flat-rolled   72,434	+8.6 pct	  68,431 (+7.3 pct)</p>
<p>   Extrusions    14,145	-2.2 pct	  14,372 (+5.2 pct)</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
